  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia &#x2013; Pacific Partnerships for Aviation Program (P4A)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment seeks to support improved aviation safety, quality and sustainability and keep the Pacific connected through engagement with relevant government ministries, airport authorities, civil aviation regulators and meteorological services. It includes the development of more harmonised aviation strategies, policies and regulations; aviation skills, education and training; improved safety and quality systems; strengthened aviation meteorological capabilities, as well as enhanced gender equality and disability inclusion in the Pacific aviation sector.</narrative>
  </description>
